        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><strong>(a) Notice.</strong> BreederHQ will tell you by email when it suspends or terminates your account, and why. Before terminating your account without cause, BreederHQ will give you at least thirty (30) days' notice. For any other suspension or termination, BreederHQ will give you notice before it takes effect where practical, and otherwise promptly after. BreederHQ may act without advance notice, and may give no notice or withhold the reason, where it reasonably believes that notice would help someone commit or conceal fraud, would put the safety of any person or animal at risk, would compromise an investigation, or would violate a law, a court order, or a request from law enforcement. This subsection also applies when BreederHQ suspends or terminates your access to the Marketplace under another User Agreement.</p>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><strong>(b) Refund on termination without cause.</strong> If BreederHQ terminates your account, your access to the Marketplace, or a paid subscription without cause, BreederHQ will refund the unused prepaid portion, calculated by day, of each subscription or other fee you paid BreederHQ for a period that had not yet ended. A termination is without cause unless it is for your breach of a User Agreement, your violation of law, fraud or BreederHQ's reasonable belief of fraud, or a risk to the safety of any person or animal. This subsection does not limit any refund another User Agreement or applicable law provides.</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2 text-gray-900">9.3 Effect of Termination</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Upon termination, your right to use the Services ceases immediately. Provisions of these Terms that by their nature should survive termination shall survive.</p>
