        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">When a new version of these Terms requires your affirmative acceptance, the version you last accepted continues to govern your use of the Services until you accept the new version. After the new version's effective date, BreederHQ may condition your continued access to the Services on your acceptance of the new version, except that BreederHQ will not condition on that acceptance your retrieval, viewing, or downloading of a Transaction Contract as described in §7C.7, or any access that applicable law requires BreederHQ to provide. The same rule applies when a new version of another User Agreement requires your affirmative acceptance: the version of that User Agreement that applied to you before continues to govern until you accept the new version, and after the new version's effective date BreederHQ may condition your continued access to the Services, or to the part of the Services that User Agreement governs, on your acceptance of it, subject to the same exceptions. You may close your account at any time under §9.1.</p>
